lt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_HouseOfGrief_Pamphlet01\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">23722175-a3cb-42b5-900b-55991c80d703</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23722175-a3cb-42b5-900b-55991c80d703\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:23722175-a3cb-42b5-900b-55991c80d703\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bloomridge_Park\" title=\"Bloomridge Park\">Bloomridge Park</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-125&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-27</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong Tavern</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;50&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-18</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Does sorrow grip your heart? Does rage cloud your mind? Do you ever wish to surrender all that holds you back in life? It can  be so, at the House of Grief. To be Unburdened of your troubles is to be reborn. Seek us out, and we shall discover the very best version of you.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714213255\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1244/1000000\nPost‐expand include size